<title>UK: Finland sets A$240 million April 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>Finland sets A$240 million April 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers IBJ International and New Japan Securities Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINLAND</p>
<p> AMT    A$240 MLN     COUPON     6.81	MATURITY    03.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    03.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.20	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  FINLAND   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
